{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FFFF YOU MACHINE is a 1st person single player fast session arena shooter with time limit. You have 15 seconds to make 303 decisions find weapons and to get more time by killing  enemies and destroying the barrels </strong> <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755420/extras/efd7d6f8f38c7fe37358b405175d1b8d.poster.avif?t=1762214117\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755420/extras/efd7d6f8f38c7fe37358b405175d1b8d.webm?t=1762214117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755420/extras/efd7d6f8f38c7fe37358b405175d1b8d.mp4?t=1762214117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >finish the level until the time ends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >kill enemies and destroy barrels to gain time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >upgrade you character by collecting skill point</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >replay the level to find all the secrets and alternative routes and unlock new levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >triple uzi // <strong>holly</strong> shotgun // mp3 gun and other classical weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >run through // arena // boss fight or custom game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >skate the wires</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >start // shoot // die // restart //\u00a0<strong>e</strong>njoy the <strong>music</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755420/extras/e8dc0b006eef9c825cf381a8cfca1ef2.poster.avif?t=1762214117\